# ==============================================================================
# Trivy Ignore File - DPN Reference Infrastructure
# ==============================================================================
# AVD IDs are from the Aqua Security Vulnerability Database:
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/azure/
#
# Format: one AVD ID or check ID per line; comments start with #
#
# Only entries confirmed to actually fire against this codebase (verified via
# `trivy fs dpn-azure-infrastructure --scanners misconfig --tf-vars
# environments/dpn_infrastructure.tfvars --format json`) are listed below.
# Trivy's resource-attribute checks generally can't flag "this resource type
# is entirely missing" (e.g. no azurerm_security_center_subscription_pricing
# resource for Defender for Cloud enrollment) - only misconfigured attributes
# on resources that exist. For the fuller picture of accepted-risk items,
# including ones Trivy's rule set doesn't independently catch, see
# .checkov.yaml, which documents each with its rationale.
# ==============================================================================

# ── Storage account geo-redundancy ────────────────────────────────────────────
# dev_storage / file_scanning_storage / observability_logging_storage use
# locally-redundant storage (LRS) to reduce cost in dev/test tier. Must be
# upgraded to GRS/RAGRS before pre-prod / production, where regional-outage
# durability matters.
AVD-AZU-0058

# ── Storage account infrastructure encryption ─────────────────────────────────
# Double encryption at the infrastructure level (infrastructure_encryption_enabled)
# is not enabled. This is separate from customer-managed key (CMK) encryption,
# which this codebase does support (see each module's "Customer-Managed Key"
# section) - infrastructure encryption is an additional platform-level layer
# on top. It is ForceNew on azurerm_storage_account - enabling it on an
# already-deployed account destroys and recreates it, so it must be set at
# initial creation for any new pre-prod / production storage account, not
# retrofitted here.
AVD-AZU-0061
